Package: nextsound
Version: @VERSION@
Section: sound
Priority: optional
Architecture: amd64
Maintainer: Made by TrungCao <namnguyenit@users.noreply.github.com>
Depends: python3 (>= 3.10), python3-gi, python3-dbus, gir1.2-gtk-4.0, gir1.2-adw-1, bluez, pipewire (>= 0.3.48), pipewire (<< 0.3.49), pipewire-pulse, wireplumber (>= 0.4), wireplumber (<< 0.5), pulseaudio-utils, libbluetooth3, libsbc1, libglib2.0-0, libdbus-1-3, libsystemd0, libudev1, libusb-1.0-0
Homepage: https://github.com/namnguyenit/NextSound
Description: Bluetooth A2DP receiver for Ubuntu
 NextSound turns an Ubuntu 22.04 computer into a Bluetooth speaker.
 It provides a GTK interface, per-stream routing and volume controls,
 and bundled receiver-capable SBC, AAC and LDAC support for PipeWire 0.3.48.
